units metal
dimension 3
boundary p p p
atom_style atomic
newton on
neighbor 2.0 bin
neigh_modify delay 10 every 1 check yes
timestep 0.001
thermo 100

lattice fcc 4.05
region box block 0 1 0 1 0 1 units lattice
create_box 1 box
create_atoms 1 box
mass 1 26.9815385
replicate 5 5 5

pair_style eam/alloy
pair_coeff * * ../../../potentials/prompt1.potential Al

velocity all create 300.0 12345 mom yes rot no dist gaussian
fix 1 all npt temp 300.0 300.0 0.1 iso 1.01325 1.01325 1.0
run 500000
unfix 1